    {
      "type": "examAlert",
      "items": [
        "The First FYP was based on the Harrod-Domar Model with a core focus on agriculture.",
        "The Second FYP was based on the Mahalanobis Model prioritizing rapid heavy industrialization.",
        "Plan Holidays (1966–1969) were instituted following the Sino-Indian and Indo-Pak wars and widespread droughts.",
        "NITI Aayog was established on January 1, 2015, promoting cooperative federalism with a bottom-up approach."
      ],
      "id": "4nit627"
